1
00:00:00,431 --> 00:00:03,101
(Leonard:)If you're not happy,
just let Kripke have the office.

2
00:00:03,309 --> 00:00:06,439
Wait, and let him win?
Do I look crazy to you?

3
00:00:06,646 --> 00:00:10,566
(Sheldon:)We're trying to think down here,
you geode-loving feldspar jockeys!

4
00:00:10,775 --> 00:00:14,525
(Sheldon:)And you,
the notes are C, D, E, G and A.

5
00:00:14,737 --> 00:00:17,327
(Sheldon:)You pick one
or I'm chopping down that tree!

6
00:00:23,079 --> 00:00:26,619
- How's that?
- Little higher on the right.

7
00:00:27,208 --> 00:00:28,538
(Sheldon:)- Now?
- Little more.

8
00:00:28,751 --> 00:00:30,921
(Amy:)No. That's got it.

9
00:00:32,922 --> 00:00:35,382
Yeah, okay. That's good.

10
00:00:36,926 --> 00:00:39,096
- I'll let you in on a little secret.
- Mm.

11
00:00:39,304 --> 00:00:42,144
(Amy:)Originally, we were painted nude.

12
00:00:48,563 --> 00:00:52,153
But I had him add clothes because
it was an unnecessary challenge...

13
00:00:52,358 --> 00:00:54,738
(Amy:)...to our heterosexuality.

14
00:00:56,446 --> 00:00:58,276
(Penny:)Yeah, good call.

15
00:00:58,948 --> 00:01:01,698
If you change your mind, all it
would take is some warm soapy water...

16
00:01:01,910 --> 00:01:03,910
(Amy:)...and a couple of sponges.

17
00:01:05,413 --> 00:01:08,333
- You're talking about the painting, right?
- Sure.

18
00:01:13,463 --> 00:01:15,843
(Sheldon:)Help! Somebody, help!

19
00:01:19,636 --> 00:01:20,676
(Leonard:)What happened?

20
00:01:20,887 --> 00:01:24,557
l was trying to see what was in here
and my head got stuck.

21
00:01:25,350 --> 00:01:26,680
(Leonard:)Why would you do that?

22
00:01:26,893 --> 00:01:29,353
(Sheldon:)It's called scientific curiosity.

23
00:01:30,355 --> 00:01:32,775
(Sheldon:)Now go get butter.

24
00:01:32,982 --> 00:01:36,272
Okay, okay. Hang in there.
I'll be right back.

